   "version": 1,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "text": "claude-code   Agent SDK · hooks + canUseTool\n              内置工具全禁 · fork_session\ncodex         openai-codex SDK（app-server JSON-RPC）\n              thread_fork · turn_steer/interrupt · 审批回调\nopencode      serve HTTP+SSE（OpenAPI 3.1 契约）\n              fork{messageID} · revert · permission 回调\n\nAgentSlot 契约：run / kill / version\nnormalize/*：原生事件 → journal 事件\n  （纯映射表，绝不丢 → raw.<slot>）",
   "fontSize": 11,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "claude-code   Agent SDK · hooks + canUseTool\n              内置工具全禁 · fork_session\ncodex         openai-codex SDK（app-server JSON-RPC）\n              thread_fork · turn_steer/interrupt · 审批回调\nopencode      serve HTTP+SSE（OpenAPI 3.1 契约）\n              fork{messageID} · revert · permission 回调\n\nAgentSlot 契约：run / kill / version\nnormalize/*：原生事件 → journal 事件\n  （纯映射表，绝不丢 → raw.<slot>）",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
