  {
   "id": "note1",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 600,
   "width": 270,
   "height": 170,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#a0a0a0",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 66,
   "version": 1,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "text": "不变量\n\n· journal 是真源，谁也不改写它\n· normalizer 绝不丢事件\n  （没映射的 → raw.<slot>）\n· agent 内置工具必须禁 —\n  它们跑在宿主机上\n· usage 各维度分开记\n· adapter 依赖的都是无承诺的\n  接口 → contracts/ 每日断言\n· 只在静止点打快照",
   "fontSize": 11,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "不变量\n\n· journal 是真源，谁也不改写它\n· normalizer 绝不丢事件\n  （没映射的 → raw.<slot>）\n· agent 内置工具必须禁 —\n  它们跑在宿主机上\n· usage 各维度分开记\n· adapter 依赖的都是无承诺的\n  接口 → contracts/ 每日断言\n· 只在静止点打快照",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "boundElements": [],
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "autoResize": true
  },
